---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Status from '../../components/Status.astro';
import Film from '../../components/Film.astro';
import { url } from '../../data/url';
---
<Base slug="habit/" title="A habit, not an addiction" description="The psychology The Cousin uses to become a weekly habit, and the tricks it deliberately leaves out.">
  <header class="wrap phead">
    <p class="chapter">06 · Psychology</p>
    <h1 class="h1" data-split="lines" data-intro>The reward is the evening, not the screen.</h1>
    <div class="headrow" data-reveal="up" data-intro data-delay="0.3">
      <p class="lede muted">Most apps win by keeping you scrolling. We win when you put the phone down and go out. That changes which hooks are fair to use.</p>
      <p class="muted">A proposal for discussion: only the peak-end rule appears in the earlier blueprint.</p>
      <Status s="open" />
    </div>
  </header>
  <section class="wrap row">
    <p class="chapter">Watch it work</p>
    <Film id="film-habit" name="habit" title="Film · The weekly loop" length="14 s" label="Animated film: a weekly loop of six steps: Thursday nudge, one-line ask, plan with friends, go out, recap, notebook grows" />
  </section>
  <section class="wrap row">
    <p class="chapter">Nine principles we use</p>
    <div class="tbl" tabindex="0"><table><thead><tr><th>Principle</th><th>What it means here</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Trigger at the right moment</td><td>Thursday evening, when people plan weekends. Never at midnight.</td></tr><tr><td>Make the action tiny</td><td>One sentence is a whole request.</td></tr><tr><td>Remove choice overload</td><td>Three ideas, not thirty.</td></tr><tr><td>Commitment</td><td>A time, a place and friends who said yes.</td></tr><tr><td>Social proof, from friends</td><td>“Priya loved this place”, never fake counts.</td></tr><tr><td>Peak and end</td><td>The recap asks for the best moment, and the plan ends gently.</td></tr><tr><td>Investment</td><td>The notebook grows; the app gets better the more you use it.</td></tr><tr><td>Variable reward, honestly</td><td>Wild cards are real surprises, not slot machines.</td></tr><tr><td>Progress you can feel</td><td>Places tried, new parts of town, clubs joined.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap row">
    <p class="chapter">Four we leave out</p>
    <div class="tbl" tabindex="0"><table><thead><tr><th>Trick</th><th>Why not</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Endless feed</td><td>Scrolling time is our failure, not our success.</td></tr><tr><td>Streaks that punish</td><td>Missing a weekend is life, not a loss.</td></tr><tr><td>Fake scarcity</td><td>“Only 2 seats left” only when it is true and confirmed.</td></tr><tr><td>Guilt notifications</td><td>At most a few a week, always useful.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
  </section>
</Base>
